WEBVTT

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.750
He triggered Flatten All, Ink Knight!

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:14.650
If that glass sheet locks, the entire desk freezes flat forever!

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.000
Then we climb the stylus before the screen shuts!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.240
Your curves and my ink can still break his lock!

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.540
Depth breeds chaos and crooked strokes.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.380
Flatten All brings silent, eternal harmony to every surface.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.150
Harmony is not a flat cage, Architect!

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.710
Every curve needs room to breathe and bend!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:09.140
Even your luminous vectors will merge into one clean plane.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.160
Join the flat grid.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:22.420
Your anchor node is cracking, Vector!

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.040
Hold my hand—we retreat to the oak desk together!

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.680
Take my vector seed to the six heroes!

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.120
Forge a hybrid stylus before the light goes flat!

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.930
We will not leave you trapped in flat glass, Vector.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:50.770
Every medium on this desk is coming back for you!
